---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "CREATING" as SDD_ST_05_CREATING
  state "PENDING" as SDD_ST_05_PENDING
  state "UNKNOWN" as SDD_ST_05_UNKNOWN
  state "PARTIAL" as SDD_ST_05_PARTIAL
  state "PAID" as SDD_ST_05_PAID
  state "UNPAID_TERMINAL" as SDD_ST_05_UNPAID_TERMINAL
  state "EXCEPTION" as SDD_ST_05_EXCEPTION
  [*] --> SDD_ST_05_CREATING : immutable order and job saved
  SDD_ST_05_CREATING --> SDD_ST_05_PENDING : verified checkout link
  SDD_ST_05_CREATING --> SDD_ST_05_UNKNOWN : provider outcome unresolved
  SDD_ST_05_PENDING --> SDD_ST_05_UNKNOWN : reconciliation cannot establish outcome
  SDD_ST_05_UNKNOWN --> SDD_ST_05_PENDING : verified pending observation
  SDD_ST_05_PENDING --> SDD_ST_05_PARTIAL : verified nonterminal partial amount
  SDD_ST_05_UNKNOWN --> SDD_ST_05_PARTIAL : verified partial observation
  SDD_ST_05_CREATING --> SDD_ST_05_PAID : full verified payment already exists
  SDD_ST_05_PENDING --> SDD_ST_05_PAID : exact verified amount / currency
  SDD_ST_05_UNKNOWN --> SDD_ST_05_PAID : reconciliation proves full payment
  SDD_ST_05_PARTIAL --> SDD_ST_05_PAID : verified full payment reached
  SDD_ST_05_PENDING --> SDD_ST_05_UNPAID_TERMINAL : provider proves terminal zero paid
  SDD_ST_05_UNKNOWN --> SDD_ST_05_UNPAID_TERMINAL : provider proves terminal zero paid
  SDD_ST_05_CREATING --> SDD_ST_05_EXCEPTION : invalid/inconsistent outcome
  SDD_ST_05_PENDING --> SDD_ST_05_EXCEPTION : mismatched verified evidence
  SDD_ST_05_PARTIAL --> SDD_ST_05_EXCEPTION : incompatible amount/outcome
  SDD_ST_05_PAID --> SDD_ST_05_PAID : duplicate observation, no duplicate<br/>application

  classDef accepted fill:#eaf6ef,stroke:#1a9e4a,color:#0f1729,stroke-width:1.5px
  class SDD_ST_05_PAID accepted

  classDef attention fill:#fdf2f2,stroke:#dc2828,color:#0f1729,stroke-width:1.5px
  class SDD_ST_05_EXCEPTION attention

  classDef working fill:#fef3eb,stroke:#e6650f,color:#0f1729,stroke-width:1.5px
  class SDD_ST_05_CREATING,SDD_ST_05_PENDING working
